.TH THUMTOO-EXPORT 1 "2026-09-25" "thumtoo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thumtoo-export \- assemble all tiles at one scale into a PNG
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thumtoo-export
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.I URI
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetches every exclusive grid cell for
.I URI
at a pyramid scale and writes one RGB PNG of the full level
.RB ( dim_at_tile_scale ).
Useful for debugging host paint vs encode (missing lines, seams).
.PP
.B \-\-raw\-pdf
rasterizes each cell with MuPDF region render (no JPEG) for PDF page URIs.
.PP
See
.B \-\-help
for options (\-\-scale, \-\-cache, \-\-force, \-\-cache\-only, \-o).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo-tile (1),
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1)
